(text "K1/K2 off = CLEAN. K1 selects input and grounds the inactive second-stage grid.\nK2 selects channel output. K2 spare pole is unused and explicitly marked.\nJ4 normal contact TN preserves the dry path with no external loop cable.\nJ6 is unassigned in the source BOM; no extra function has been invented.\nRelay candidate is high-sensitivity H1; source relays had no actual part identity." (at 18 160 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) ) (justify left top)) (uuid 8652f825-a015-56c5-9152-e3c7ae53a0f9))
